<title>NETHERLANDS: KNP BT Q4 ordinary net slumps.</title>
<headline>KNP BT Q4 ordinary net slumps.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth quarter 1996</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit from ordinary ops	  92.00  vs  151.00</p>
<p>    Net per ord share (guilders)	   0.82  vs    1.41</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			3.65  vs    3.91</p>
<p>    Operating profit			 196.00  vs  247.00</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items			nil   vs   75.0 charge</p>
<p>    Net profit				  92.00  vs   76.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Dutch paper group NV Koninklijke KNP BT was forecast by analysts to post fourth-quarter profits of between 62-107 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 570 8500</p>
</text>
